<p>You displace <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 13%, 17%, 19%, 22%</acronym> of any damage you receive onto a random bleeding enemy within range 5. This redirected damage is amplified by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">120%, 146%, 163%, 177%, 187%.</acronym></p><p></p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">All living things are linked by blood. It is one river, flowing through all.</span></span></p>